ies and did not have visual or auditory awareness.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026638547","violation_type_title":"Report Situation Placing Children at Risk (26 TAC §746.305(a)(6))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1370468-i20250731-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1205-a-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1370468-i20250731","date":"2025-07-31","original_code":"746.1205(a)(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-09-12","finding":"Supervision ensures each child?s safety, well-being, including physical proximity and auditory or visual awareness of each child?s on going activity: Based on the evidence obtained during the investigation, the staff were unaware of the on-going activities and lacked auditory and visual awareness of a child they were responsible for when the child was left behind outside in the playground for less than 3 minutes. Additionally, the child was discovered by another individual followed by the director and then the staff were made aware that the child had been left behind and was not with the group of children they were responsible for.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026638546","violation_type_title":"Supervision ensures each child?s safety, well-being, including physical proximity and auditory or visual awareness of each child?s on going activity (26 TAC §746.1205(a)(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1370468-i20250716","date":"2025-07-16","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905846720","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905846720","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2025-07-16","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1370468-i20250630","date":"2025-06-30","insp